{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 34","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of solutions to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a524cc57158030634b0d1d220415cb86891a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = d^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" /> of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/460b8fe56324f2fbf95fd587d24a4ba56fafdc23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a,b,c\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> are three consecutive square numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is also a square number, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5bdd02d0d68fbe1c6b712a3975ea37d0ce3f0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=x^2, b=(x+1)^2, c=(x+2)^2, d = y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"319\" height=\"21\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are integers. Then we have the following result: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/4/fa4abda1025c82c44736e93b7bceb92df3dff31d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+(x+1)^4+(x+2)^4=y^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"232\" height=\"21\" />.\nThis equation has no solutions in the integers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00ec80839cb3199a05613fc44be73dc682906b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x=0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</